OL,3,GNEWSAWhales found dead after pod
OL,4,Aspotted in Thames
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo whales have died after a pod was
OL,7,Fspotted in the Thames Estuary.
OL,9,FBritish Divers Marine Life Rescue
OL,10,F(BDMLR) said it was called after
OL,11,Freports that 25 long-finned pilot
OL,12,Fwhales were seen close to Coalhouse
OL,13,FFort at East Tilbury and at Tilbury in
OL,14,FEssex on Thursday.
OL,16,FOne whale, a female, was found dead on
OL,17,FSaturday and another was found on
OL,18,FSunday morning.
OL,20,FTheir presence in the Thames and the
OL,21,Fsouthern North Sea was uncommon, said a
OL,22,FBDMLR spokesperson.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
